# 必填：细粒度 Token，仅选择 Profile 仓库并授予 Contents 读写权限。
# Required: fine-grained PAT, selected Profile repository, Contents read/write only.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# 必填：已存在的 GitHub Profile 仓库，格式为 owner/repo。
# Required: your existing GitHub Profile repository, in owner/repo format.
GITHUB_REPOSITORY=your-name/your-name

# 可选：codex.exe 的绝对路径；留空自动发现。
# Optional: absolute path to codex.exe. Leave empty for automatic discovery.
CODEX_BIN=

# 可选：IANA 显示时区；留空使用本机时区。
# Optional: IANA display timezone. Leave empty to use this computer's timezone.
TIMEZONE=
